  "description": "The Coaster is an affordable version of our Parser model. Odyssey pedals, super durable BMX 3pc cranks and a sealed Mid bottom bracket power a proven Shimano coaster brake hub. The frame comes with a welded on coaster brake mount and simple slotted dropouts with rack/fender mounts. Fairdale Archer bars with Odyssey grips create a comfortable riding position and confidence inspiring 38mm wide tires eat up the bumps. A extremely special and limited edition all chrome version is available.\n\nAvailable in Chrome, Terra-Cotta or Midnight Blue.\n\nAvailable in Small, Medium, Large or Extra Large.",
